1
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:07,960
臺中東邊的山城新社，雲霧繚繞著層層河階台地。
<i>Xinshe, a mountain town east of Taichung, wrapped in mist over its river terraces.</i>

2
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:14,385
兩百年前，客家先民在這裡開墾，建起九個庄頭。
<i>Two centuries ago, Hakka settlers cleared this land and founded nine villages.</i>

3
00:00:21,984 --> 00:00:27,843
相傳一百八十多年前，一名採樟工人上山躲雨。
<i>Legend says that over 180 years ago, a camphor worker sheltered from the rain.</i>

4
00:00:28,044 --> 00:00:33,520
他發現一尊淋濕的媽祖神像，便將她迎回庄裡。
<i>He found a rain-soaked statue of Mazu and carried her home to the village.</i>

5
00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:40,724
媽祖屢顯靈驗，九個庄頭決定輪流奉祀。
<i>Mazu answered many prayers, so nine villages agreed to host her in turn.</i>

6
00:00:40,924 --> 00:00:46,205
山頂、新社、土城、畚箕湖……九庄輪流迎請媽祖。
<i>Shanding, Xinshe, Tucheng, Benjihu... nine villages take turns welcoming her.</i>

7
00:00:48,305 --> 00:00:53,221
她不住廟宇，而是住進爐主家中的紅壇。
<i>She has no temple; she lives at the red altar in the host family's home.</i>

8
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:57,425
所以人們說，九庄媽是「有神無廟」。
<i>That is why people say she is "a goddess without a temple."</i>

9
00:00:59,526 --> 00:01:05,745
誰來當爐主？信徒虔誠擲筊，請媽祖親自挑選。
<i>Who will host her? Devotees cast moon blocks and let Mazu choose.</i>

10
00:01:07,845 --> 00:01:12,733
每年農曆初三到初七，擇一天出巡遊庄。
<i>Each year, on one day between the 3rd and 7th of Lunar New Year, she tours.</i>

11
00:01:12,933 --> 00:01:18,629
天還沒亮，信眾就提燈集合，恭迎媽祖起駕。
<i>Before dawn, devotees gather with lanterns to escort Mazu out.</i>

12
00:01:20,729 --> 00:01:25,597
神轎出發，鑼鼓與鞭炮聲響徹山間小路。
<i>The palanquin sets off; gongs, drums and firecrackers fill the mountain lanes.</i>

13
00:01:25,797 --> 00:01:29,891
這是全臺灣每年最早登場的媽祖遶境。
<i>It is the earliest Mazu procession of the year in all of Taiwan.</i>

14
00:01:31,991 --> 00:01:37,300
沿途信徒跪在路旁鑽轎腳，祈求一年平安。
<i>Along the way, devotees kneel to pass beneath the palanquin, praying for peace.</i>

15
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:45,301
輪值庄頭辦桌款待，八庄挺一庄，人情最濃。
<i>The host village sets out a feast; eight villages stand by one, full of warmth.</i>

16
00:01:47,401 --> 00:01:53,613
吉時一到，香爐過爐交接，媽祖在新爐主家安座。
<i>At the auspicious hour, the incense burner passes on, and Mazu settles in her new home.</i>

17
00:01:55,713 --> 00:02:01,900
二〇〇九年，九庄媽遶境登錄為臺中民俗文化資產。
<i>In 2009, the procession was registered as a Taichung folk cultural heritage.</i>

18
00:02:02,100 --> 00:02:08,434
水底寮退出後，新社庄多輪一次，仍守九年一輪。
<i>When Shuidiliao withdrew, Xinshe took an extra turn to keep the nine-year cycle.</i>

19
00:02:10,534 --> 00:02:15,498
九年一輪，媽祖走過每一戶人家的門口。
<i>Every nine years, Mazu passes by the door of every family.</i>

20
00:02:15,698 --> 00:02:20,473
沒有廟宇的高牆，她就住在人們的心裡。
<i>Without temple walls, she lives in the hearts of her people.</i>

21
00:02:20,673 --> 00:02:26,450
兩百年的香火，一代接著一代，繼續走下去。
<i>Two hundred years of incense, passed from generation to generation, walk on.</i>
